        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu nikyo ekigambo MUKAMA eki yagambiire Hoseya omu biro bya Uziya, Yosamu, Ahazi na Hezekiya abakama ba Yuda, n'omu bwa Yerobbowamu mutabani wa Yowaasi Omukama wa Isirairi, mutabani wa Beeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
